WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:04.733
Video twenty-seven. Help, the support file,
and updates.

00:00:04.933 --> 00:00:08.284
F1 opens the help for the screen that you are
on.

00:00:08.214 --> 00:00:11.099
The manual explains every part of Hisaab.

00:00:11.029 --> 00:00:15.048
When a problem stays, save a support file, and
write to us.

00:00:15.348 --> 00:00:19.300
Here is the Balance Sheet. On any screen,
press F1.

00:00:19.330 --> 00:00:24.546
The Help menu opens. F1 again opens the page
of the manual for this screen.

00:00:24.576 --> 00:00:28.461
Here is the page for the Balance Sheet, with
the keys of the report.

00:00:30.826 --> 00:00:35.643
F1, N opens the whole manual: from Getting
Started to the Windows app.

00:00:37.481 --> 00:00:42.365
When a problem stays: F1, Troubleshooting,
Save a Support File.

00:00:42.395 --> 00:00:49.811
Hisaab puts the error log, the versions and the settings into one
zip file on your Desktop. Passwords and keys stay out.

00:00:49.841 --> 00:00:53.312
Press Ctrl+A to accept, and the file is on the
Desktop.

00:00:52.962 --> 00:00:56.993
Hisaab sends nothing by itself: you attach the
file to an e-mail.

00:00:58.073 --> 00:01:02.356
F1, W shows What's New: the changes of each
version.

00:01:03.055 --> 00:01:09.539
F1, U checks for a new version. This PC has
the latest version, 1.0.4.

00:01:10.690 --> 00:01:16.775
In the Windows app, Hisaab asks one question when a new
version is ready. It shows the release notes.

00:01:16.705 --> 00:01:19.388
Yes backs up every company first.

00:01:19.319 --> 00:01:23.670
Then Hisaab installs the new version, and
starts again with your companies.

00:01:23.869 --> 00:01:27.888
Questions? Write to info@nexertechnology.com.

00:01:27.818 --> 00:01:30.835
Attach the support file, and write the steps.

